1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,590
VidSearch: VidSearch is a lightweight multimodal video understanding and retrieval

2
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:14,330
What it is: It extracts key frames from video

3
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:20,800
vidsearch/cli.py: is the command-line interface for VidSearch video retrieval engine

4
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:28,230
vidsearch/search.py: queries vector index

5
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:34,250
main: runs CLI search execution

6
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:40,400
Install: pip install -r requirements.txt

7
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:44,620
Run: python -m vidsearch.cli --query "sunset over ocean" --index index.faiss --fps 1.0

8
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:52,230
Pipeline Stages: decode, embed, index and query

9
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:58,950
Next Step: inspect vidsearch/cli.py
